                  <lb /><hi rendition="#g">and many failures</hi>
                  <lb />the perfect instrument 
               </seg>
            </hi></ab>
      </div>
      <div facs="#eSc_textblock_7146ee55">
         <ab><hi rendition="#c">
            <hi rendition="#i">
               <lb />The <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name>
               <seg xml:id="topic_2" resp="#np" type="topic" ana="#exact_reproduction">
                  faithfully reproduces the
                  <lb />individual interpretation of the
                  <lb />greatest Pianists
               </seg>
            </hi>
         </hi></ab>
      </div>
      <div facs="#eSc_textblock_527025e7">
         <ab><hi rendition="#c #uc">
